+        // A GESTURE on the rig (pure; SelfTest pins it): a named clip that is neither the rig's own nor a loco family -- the only ids
+        // whose RunAnimation (and jump slot: KeepJumpTimeline) keeps the SOURCE timeline. For every id that is not the rig's own,
+        // IsGesture is "B_FRAME answers stock" (BFrameTarget(...) == id) BY CONSTRUCTION (both read IsLocoFamily): SelfTest's
+        // one-timeline row is a REFACTOR PIN of that pairing, not a proof that every site agrees. It holds where the source timeline
